OL,3,GNEWSA'Nightmare' since house next door
OL,4,Awas demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman claims her home has been
OL,7,Fplagued with issues after her neighbour
OL,8,Fdemolished and failed to rebuild the
OL,9,Fadjoining property.
OL,11,FShivarna Mitra bought her semi-detached
OL,12,Fhouse in Pudsey, Leeds, in 2021 as a
OL,13,Ffresh start for her family. The house
OL,14,Fnext door was sold the following year
OL,15,Fand the new owner began work on the
OL,16,Fproperty, but demolished it without
OL,17,Fplanning permission due to safety
OL,18,Fconcerns.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
