OL,3,GNEWSA'Nightmare' since house next door
OL,4,Awas demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds City Council retrospectively
OL,7,Frefused a demolition application and
OL,8,Fthe other half of the semi has never
OL,9,Fbeen reinstated.
OL,11,FShe said: "We've got damp on the walls,
OL,12,Frats have been eating the electrics,
OL,13,Fwe've had squirrels in the cavity
OL,14,Fwalls, holes in the roof - the list is
OL,15,Fendless."
